{"id":"n184685ec45","headline":"Gold and silver prices drop amid dollar strength and hawkish Fed outlook","summary":"Precious metals experienced a sharp sell-off, with silver plunging 41% over six months and gold declining 19%. The rout is driven by a strengthening US dollar and expectations of further Federal Reserve rate hikes.","why":"Gold and silver are non-yielding assets that typically perform poorly when interest rates rise and the dollar strengthens, as investors shift capital toward higher-yielding Treasuries.","category":"commodities","event_type":"commodity-prices","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Global","country":"United States of America","lat":37.09,"lon":-95.713,"region":"na"},"entities":[{"name":"Gold","ticker":"GC=F","kind":"company","sym":"XAU","asset":{"id":"CM:XAU","n":"Gold","c":"commodity","px":"GC=F","la":51.51,"lo":-0.09,"geo":"markets","site":"XAU","m":"ticker-fixed","rv":"registry-v1"}}],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/commodities/news/from-record-highs-to-a-brutal-rout-what-is-behind-the-meltdown-in-gold-and-silver/articleshow/136051518.cms"},"sources":[{"name":"Economic Times","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/commodities/news/from-record-highs-to-a-brutal-rout-what-is-behind-the-meltdown-in-gold-and-silver/articleshow/136051518.cms"},{"name":"Business Insider Polska","url":"https://businessinsider.com.pl/poradnik-finansowy/inwestowanie/dlaczego-zloto-traci-na-wartosci-eksperci-wskazuja-kluczowe-powody/215079h"}],"published_at":"2026-11-21T10:09:46Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-21T11:27:43Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"score":61.0,"content_hash":"24114495de002197","impacts":[],"why_moved":"The combination of a stronger dollar and expectations of higher interest rates makes non-yielding assets like gold less attractive to investors.","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/gold-bars-2496347.jpg","alt":"gold bars (illus